Only allow this for an app you trust.␀␀Allow␀␀␀"%s" wants to send PRIVATE messages as you.

It could write to any of your contacts, or post to a room, and the message will look exactly like one you typed.

Only allow this for an app you trust.␀␀␀␀"%s" wants to send discovery probes.

Each probe asks every node in range to reply, so it uses airtime on the whole local mesh, not just yours.

Nothing is sent under your name and no message is transmitted.␀Mark all chats and channels as read?␀␀␀␀Mark read␀␀␀Nothing selected␀␀␀␀Delete %d contact(s)?␀␀␀Purge all discovered nodes?␀Purge␀␀␀Team is not set up yet␀␀Cancel your SOS?␀␀␀␀Cancel SOS␀␀Send SOS to the team with your position?␀␀␀␀Send SOS␀␀␀␀Stop following the route?␀␀␀Stop Bloodhound?␀␀␀␀Delete the pad and every message of this conversation?␀␀Wipe this pad? Messages already received stay readable; nothing new can be sent or read until a new pad is added.␀␀␀Clear the coverage map? The file on the card is kept.␀␀␀Roll to highlight вЂў click to insert␀␀␀Emoji␀␀␀cut␀Special characters␀␀Insert emoji / symbol␀␀␀No blocked users.

